                                "sense_id": "0cb6d8ea-7a12-3cbd-aa12-d9609386c933",
                                "text": "“The Bynar ship went missing on stardate 58934.9.” “Okay, so your intel is legit, but this still feels like a trick.” “No. I'm a changed computer. Just look at me. Do you see the blue light?” “The light is reassuring.”"
