                                "sense_id": "454170b9-2e98-3b30-ab91-4b2576110eaa",
                                "text": "If you neglect ex-planet Pluto's orbit, which is inclined 17 degrees from the plane of Earth's orbit, all the legit planet planes (as well as the equator of the Sun) lie within about 7 degrees of one another."
